{"id": "EUVD-2026-98693", "enisaUuid": "f3eb5bf8-4799-3a97-ac31-82a1016649b4", "description": "yt-dlp-web-ui through 4.0.0 contains a NULL pointer dereference vulnerability in the Service.Formats JSON-RPC method that allows remote unauthenticated attackers to crash the server. Attackers can send a single request with a url value like --version, causing invalid yt-dlp JSON output and an unrecovered panic that terminates the process.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T14:00:18", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T21:57:12", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/vazzzy071-crypto/security-advisories/blob/main/advisories/2026-10-marcopiovanello-yt-dlp-web-ui-rpc-arg-injection.md", "https://github.com/marcopiovanello/yt-dlp-web-ui/blob/v4.0.0/server/rpc/service.go", "https://github.com/marcopiovanello/yt-dlp-web-ui/blob/v4.0.0/server/formats/parser.go", "https://github.com/marcopiovanello/yt-dlp-web-ui", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/yt-dlp-web-ui-through-4.0.0-null-pointer-dereference-dos-via-service-formats"], "aliases": ["GHSA-vw64-j3q3-fxf9", "CVE-2026-109967"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.56, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2869324d-a9af-3a0b-b48d-b0993bc25d9b", "product": {"name": "yt-dlp-web-ui", "vendor": {"name": "marcopiovanello"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22644.0.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "20414227-3955-3329-b610-8cada678eb6f", "vendor": {"name": "marcopiovanello"}}], "isExploited": false}